# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Lead delivery — REQUIRED
#
# Without this the contact form and the chat widget both return an error
# rather than accepting a lead. That is deliberate: an unconfigured deploy
# should fail visibly, not swallow enquiries while showing "Message received."
#
# Get the access key from https://web3forms.com (it is tied to the address
# leads are delivered to). Set it in the Vercel project settings — do not
# commit the real value.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=

# Optional second recipient, copied on every lead. Useful while the site is
# being handed over, or as insurance against the primary inbox filtering it —
# nothing else stores these leads.
# LEAD_TO=AT@andrethomaslaw.com
